{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026DmcvPRfXg61793607772.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>內地股市回升，據報內地研究穩定A股措施。</p><p></p><p>四大指數升幅約百分之1。滬深300指數升至4,000點水平。深證成分指數，重回11,000點水平。    深圳創業板指數曾升逾百分之3，一度突破2,500點大關。滬深京三市成交，1.8萬億元人民幣。</p><p></p><p>金融、遊戲和白酒股造好。貴金屬則下跌。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T09:23:42.685264+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":140,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T08:10:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T23:38:09.815030+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T09:19:51.578710+00:00","content_hash":"c0329dd00d98fabf1dc2ad6fac46be988bbbae54f36366fc8116ebb28acf5a89","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T09:23:42.685264+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}